44: <div id="intro"><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">A first-person folk horror · Tamil Nadu, 1998</div><h1>THE LAST<br>LAMP</h1><div class="subtitle">Some truths are sealed behind stone.</div><div class="rule"></div><p>In the village of Vellimalai, people say a blood-faced woman haunts the old hill temple. She never crosses its threshold. You are an investigator, called to learn what happened to <i>Valli</i>—and why her spirit still waits.</p><p class="storyline">“The storm took her voice. The village took her name. Find the three offerings, and let the temple remember.”</p><div class="controls"><span><b>W A S D</b> move</span><span><b>Mouse</b> look</span><span><b>E</b> inspect / use</span><span><b>Shift</b> run</span><span><b>J</b> journal</span></div><button class="btn" id="startBtn">Enter the temple</button><span style="color:#8f8b80;font-size:10px;margin-left:12px">Headphones recommended</span></div></div>
